27:["$","article",null,{"className":"prose prose-gray prose-lg max-w-none prose-headings:font-bold prose-headings:text-gray-900 prose-h2:text-2xl prose-h2:mt-10 prose-h2:mb-4 prose-h3:text-lg prose-h3:mt-6 prose-h3:mb-3 prose-p:text-gray-600 prose-p:leading-relaxed prose-p:mb-5 prose-li:text-gray-600 prose-ul:space-y-1 prose-a:text-blue-600 prose-a:no-underline hover:prose-a:underline","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":"Running a hotel, guesthouse, or lodge without a management system means manual reservation books, double bookings, forgotten housekeeping schedules, and billing errors that frustrate guests and cost revenue. As the African hospitality sector grows — in Ghana, Nigeria, Kenya, and beyond — the hotels that run on proper software consistently outperform those that don't."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"This guide covers what hotel management software should include, what African hotels need specifically, and what to look for when choosing a system in 2026."}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"What hotel management software should include"}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Reservation and booking management"}]," — front desk reservations, booking calendar, walk-in and advance bookings"]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Room management"}]," — room types, rates, availability, maintenance status"]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Guest management"}]," — guest profiles, preferences, visit history, check-in/check-out"]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Billing and invoicing"}]," — room charges, restaurant add-ons, service charges, group billing"]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Housekeeping"}]," — room status tracking, cleaning schedules, staff task assignment"]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Point of sale"}]," — restaurant, bar, and room service billing linked to guest account"]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Channel management"}]," — integration with Booking.com, Airbnb, and other OTAs (for properties using online booking platforms)"]}],["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Reporting"}]," — occupancy reports, revenue per room, booking sources, financial summaries"]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"What African hotels need specifically"}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Offline reliability"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Power interruptions are common across West and East Africa. Your hotel cannot stop checking guests in because the internet is down. The system must work offline with local data storage and sync when connectivity is restored."}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Mobile money and cash payment support"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"In Ghana, Nigeria, and Kenya, guests pay by mobile money (MTN MoMo, M-Pesa, Opay), card, and cash. The system needs to handle multiple payment types and log them accurately without manual reconciliation."}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Local currency and tax compliance"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Invoices and reports need to work in local currency with correct VAT/NHIL handling. International hotel software often produces invoices that don't meet local compliance requirements."}],["$","h2",null,{"children":"RaveSoft Hotel Management System"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"RaveSoft's Hotel Management System is built for hotels and guesthouses across Africa — from boutique properties to multi-property groups."}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li",null,{"children":"Reservation calendar with room availability view"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Guest check-in/check-out with profile management"}],["$","li",null,{"children":"Room status and housekeeping management"}],"$L2a","$L2b","$L2c","$L2d","$L2e","$L2f"]}],"$L30","$L31"]}]
